ern skies  Merlin then says that she will be  rejoining the seven deadly sins for now  and we see the development of a whole  bunch of romances and shipping this  includes Elizabeth ex malleolus King X  Diane Gauss ER ex Jia ban ex Jericho  guilts under ex Margaret and of course  Merlyn X Anna Mac at the end of the  first season we see Elizabeth along with  the seven deadly sins setting up for a  brand new adventure this time to King  Arthur's Kingdom of Camelot although  bond and King set off on their own for a  while at this point we still don't know  what exactly happened ten years ago and  how exactly the seven deadly sins were  framed  in the epilogue after the final credits  we see gills under green Maura and  Hauser researching ancient symbols and  they noticed that both Meili oldest and  Henrickson had this particular symbol  appear on their face since we know that  Hendrickson had injected himself with  demon blood before the symbol appeared  this proves that melio does also has  demon blood and it's somehow connected  to the banished demon clan now that we  talked about the conclusion to season 1  we are going to talk about the OVA  so be warned OVA spoilers will follow  the two original OVA ZAR pretty simple  one of them is basically filler and the  other one tells the backstory of bond  and how we first met Elaine and drank  from the fountain of you the other thing  that we have to talk about though is the  four episode signs of the holy war OVA  which aired in August and September of  2016  episode 1 of the OVA is mostly  lighthearted but we do learn some  important information near the end  for example we learned that bond wants  to destroy the remains of the great  demon but Merlin stops him because she  considers the demon to be an important  research specimen also at the very end  of the episode we see Mellie Otis  visiting the horn of fair Neuros which  is located the needs to kingdom of  Leona's and which allows people to  communicate with the realm of the  goddess clan this is the same object  that bond encountered in episode 21 when  the goddess told him that she would  bring Elaine back to life if he killed  Mellie Otis at this point it is revealed  that Mellie Otis is actually over 3,000  years old and that he is indeed  connected to the demon clan which fought  against the other clans in the holy war  melio does confronts the goddess for  lying to his friend bond about bringing  Elaine back from the dead but the  goddess taunts him by saying that no  matter what he does those he loves and  cares about will all abandon him once  they learn about his sin man Yoda then  goes on to destroy the horn but of  course this makes us wonder what's in  the melee Olas commit and how could it  be so great that no matter what he does  the people that love will all abandon  him once they learn what he did this I'm  sure will be a big plot point in season  2 and I'm looking forward to finding out  what this sin was after the closing  credits we learned even more a small boy  spots the same bird-like creature that  was first seen flying away in the  final episode of season 1 immediately  after Hendrickson's defeat and at this  point we learned that this creature is  actually a flying arm  most probably Hendrickson's arm we then  see Dreyfus reappear again to ask this  boy about the flying arm that he just  saw proving yet again then in the seven  deadly sins no one really freakin dies  not too much happens in episode 2 of  signs of the holy war except King Bartra  has a mysterious vision and King  demonstrates his amazing dancing fairy  fighting technique 10 out of 10 in  episode 3 the flying armed finally  reaches its destination and what do you  know it is the body of Hendrickson who  is still freakin alive even though he is  badly injured at this point Dreyfus  arrives and gives Henriksen some of his  own blood in order to heal him and they  have a very they were born to make  history type of moment until it is  revealed that Dreyfus now also has the  mark of the demon clan on his face  implying that he himself is now a demon  or that he is being possessed by one in  Episode four we learned that the red  demon and the great demon are actually  among the weakest of the demon clan and  that the strongest demons are known as  the ten commandments and they serve  directly under the demon king we also  learned that King Boris mysterious  vision was of 10 Dark Shadows rising  from the southern kingdom of Camelot and  of course 10 shadow seems to allude to  the Ten Commandment we then see  Hendrickson seemingly opening the seal  that had been keeping the demon clan  locked inside the coffin of eternal  darkness implying that in season two we  are going to witness the seven deadly  sins fighting against the ten  commandments and other powerful demons  in Camelot and that is everything we  know so far about seven deadly sins  season two both in terms of the  production and in terms of the plot here  on this channel we're going to continue  to keep a close eye on any news coming  on about seven deadly sin season 2 so if  you want to be the first to know be sure  to subscribe and be sure to click that  notification valve if you want to chat  with us on a daily basis you can join  our discord server the link is in the  description and I want to give a big  thank you to my man Brig  from all day anime for helping me out  with this video Riggs has already made a  whole bunch of great videos on the seven  deadly sins so I'm going to link his  seven deadly sins playlist right here be  sure to check it out  thank you so much for watching guys  thanks for all your support and until  next time see ya space Cowboys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

